Native adapter dependency versions are pinned by Google MCP Toolbox v1.17.0,
commit 45ed205cc8682ed066c82e0b65bcd0e8fc3becce (Apache-2.0).
The native adapter is an independently authored replacement for the upstream
Firestore runtime surface, using the official Google Cloud Firestore v1 client
and protobuf types under that dependency lock. It does not include Firebase
Rules or upstream high-level Firestore CRUD implementations.
Third-party Go module license notices are included in third_party/.
